{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06447","headline":"送暨道士还玉清观 · 李颀","name":"送暨道士还玉清观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙宫有名籍，度世吴江濆。\n大道本无我，青春长与君。\n中州俄已到，至理得而闻。\n明主降黄屋，时人看白云。\n空山何窈窕，三秀日氛氲。\n遂此留书客，超遥烟驾分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}